@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 //! `ling-exl3-layers DIR REF OUT`: real EXL3 layers, each on the reference's own input rows (teacher-forced).
-//! REF (tools/g2/ling_layers_ref.py, exllamav3): "TFLX3L01", u32 T, D, n, i32 ids[T], u32 layer[n], then per layer
